<title>HONG KONG: Hongkong Land to repurchase shares.</title>
<headline>Hongkong Land to repurchase shares.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hongkong Land Holdings Ltd said on Tuesday it would implement a share repurchase and intended to buy back through the market up to five percent of its issued share capital.  </p>
<p>&quot;This repurchase programme is designed to benefit all shareholders by enhancing net asset value per share and earnings per share,&quot; managing director Percy Weatherall said in a statement.</p>
<p>&quot;The programme will utilise the powers previously granted by shareholders, and will continue while market conditions remain favourable,&quot; he added.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6345</p>
